                                                <objectDesc>
                                                    <supportDesc>
                                                        <support>
                                                            <note xml:lang="ar"/>
                                                        </support>
                                                        <extent>
                                                            <measure unit="folio">٢٨١</measure>
                                                            <dimensions>
                                                                <height unit="mm">٢٦.٥ cm</height>
                                                                <width unit="mm">16 cm</width>
                                                            </dimensions>
                                                        </extent>
                                                        <collation>
                                                            <note xml:lang="ar">
                                                                <p>The text is written in a poorly legible Naskh hand.</p>
                                                            </note>
                                                        </collation>
                                                    </supportDesc>
                                                    <layoutDesc>
                                                        <summary>
                                                            <note>
                                                                <p>The manuscript is worn and deteriorated in several places. The margins are narrow, and the edges are cropped and damaged. The opening lines of some pages, as well as the beginning and end of the text, have also suffered damage.</p>
                                                                <p>The handwritten text differs from that of Manuscript No. 3, and both differ from the printed edition.</p>
                                                                <p>This manuscript is listed in Gibson’s catalogue under the title Kitāb Maqālāt ʿan Sīrat Ibrāhīm (Book of Essays on the Life of Abraham).</p>
                                                                <p>It was microfilmed in 1950 by a joint expedition of the Library of Congress and Alexandria University.</p>
                                                            </note>
                                                        </summary>
                                                    </layoutDesc>
                                                </objectDesc>
                                                <handDesc>
                                                    <handNote medium="black" xml:id="hand-1">
                                                        <note>
                                                            <p>The handwriting shows a slight improvement in quality and legibility in the third book, Leviticus, but thereafter reverts to its initial condition.</p>
                                                        </note>
                                                    </handNote>
                                                </handDesc>
                                                <additions>
                                                    <list>
                                                        <item xml:id="addition-1">
                                                            <objectType>Colophon</objectType>
                                                            <locus from="281 r"/>
                                                            <quote type="transcription" xml:lang="ar">
                                                                <p>انقضى نسخها يوم الجمعة لثلث ليال خلون من رجب سنة ثلث وخمسين وثلثمايه وكان ذلك اليوم من تموز يوم عيد مار قراقوس وهي بخط جبريل بن موسى المعروف -حسلعه- ! الكاتب رضي الله عنه رضا ابراره واحبابه ورحم من قرأ أو قري عليه فقال امين امين.</p>
                                                            </quote>
                                                        </item>
                                                        <item xml:id="addition-2">
                                                            <objectType>Proofreading note</objectType>
                                                            <locus from="281 r"/>
                                                            <quote type="transcription" xml:lang="ar">
                                                                <p>An additional note, written in a neat Naskh hand distinct from the original script, appears to have been added by one of the readers on folio 281 r:</p>
                                                                <p>طالع في هذه التوريه المقدسه عبد عبيد الكلمه الالهيه ميخاييل المصري بدير طورسينا المقدس وذلك في سنة سبعمايه وادح للهجرة الرب الاله يعني لمن دعى له.</p>
                                                                <p/>
                                                            </quote>
                                                        </item>
